  ▌ keyway inspect <query>... [options]

  Show where a host resolves, as ssh sees it (ssh -G).

  Options:
       --json  Output as JSON

  Global Options: See `keyway --help`

  Examples:
  Show where a host resolves
    keyway inspect stg-consul1

  Inspect the one host that a query matches
    keyway inspect new consul

  Read one field in a script
    keyway inspect stg-consul1 --json | jq -r .resolved.hostname
